{
  "episode_id": "2026-10-09",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听众朋友大家好，欢迎收听AI 每日先锋，今天是2026年10月9日。我是苏晴。",
      "start": 1.0,
      "duration": 7.576,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_001_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。苏晴今天一脸兴奋，是看到什么好东西了？",
      "start": 9.025,
      "duration": 4.963,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那可不，DeepMind干了个事儿我到现在还没消化完。你知道他们干了什么吗？把人类基因组里所有可能的单字母DNA变异，大概90亿个，的分子效应画成了一张预测图谱——AlphaGenome Atlas。",
      "start": 14.485,
      "duration": 17.217,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个我看了。你乍一听可能觉得有点学术，但你注意啊，它的意义不在于又多了一个AI模型，而在于它把整个\"基因组暗物质\"给照亮了。",
      "start": 32.155,
      "duration": 10.623,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "\"基因组暗物质\"这说法我一听就懂了，你给我们翻译翻译呗。",
      "start": 43.183,
      "duration": 5.529,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这么想，人类基因组有30亿个碱基对，每个人跟标准参考之间有几百万个差异。但绝大多数差异到底有没有功能、会不会致病，过去是不知道的。这就像你拿到一份代码，里面99%的变量你不清楚是核心算法还是废弃注释。AlphaGenome做的就是给每个可能的单碱基变异\"打分\"，影响不影响力基因表达、会不会破坏蛋白结合位点、跟疾病关联多大。",
      "start": 49.145,
      "duration": 29.731,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那过去这种事儿怎么做？",
      "start": 79.341,
      "duration": 2.656,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "过去要么是湿实验，培养细胞、测序、看表达，一个变异研究几周。要么就只能靠运气和文献。这对罕见病家庭来说太残酷了，孩子查出一个罕见变异告诉你\"这个变异意义不明\"，家长得多崩溃。",
      "start": 82.459,
      "duration": 15.954,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "是，那种等待确诊的过程真的煎熬。",
      "start": 98.864,
      "duration": 3.918,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "所以这张分子影响地图厉害在哪儿呢？它本质上是把\"意义不明\"这个回答从字典里删了。任何研究者拿到一个变异位点，都可以在模型里先预测它的分子效应，再决定要不要做实验验证。整个基因组研究的迭代周期被压缩了一两个数量级。",
      "start": 103.282,
      "duration": 19.655,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这等于说AI for Science进入了一个\"可信依赖\"的阶段？以前是辅助工具，现在是基础设施了。",
      "start": 123.375,
      "duration": 7.314,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错，这是个分水岭。以前AI for Science是锦上添花，能做就做，不做也行。现在它变成科研流程里绕不开的环节，不用就落后。",
      "start": 131.15,
      "duration": 10.928,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那对药物研发的影响呢？",
      "start": 142.523,
      "duration": 1.872,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你想，药物靶点发现的核心问题就是\"这个位点能不能动、动了会怎样\"。现在你可以在计算机里先扫一遍90亿个变异的效应图谱，找到那些动不得的关键位点绕开，找到那些动一下就有戏的位点重点攻。对整个精准医学的迭代速度，是质变的影响。",
      "start": 144.869,
      "duration": 20.308,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说完了基因组，咱们聊聊大模型价格战。这才是今天最热闹的话题吧？",
      "start": 165.604,
      "duration": 5.965,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "Anthropic这次确实有点狠。你注意啊，他们用更小参数量的模型，在多项基准上把对手按在地上摩擦。OpenAI那边据说只能送点\"重置卡\"给开发者安抚情绪。",
      "start": 172.033,
      "duration": 13.864,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈哈哈\"送重置卡\"也太惨了。但说真的，\"小而强\"这个路线业界喊了好几年了，为什么这次特别值得关注？",
      "start": 186.314,
      "duration": 8.316,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "因为这次不是某一家在喊，是整个行业的竞争逻辑在切换。以前大家比的是参数规模，谁的模型大谁就是老大。",
      "start": 195.066,
      "duration": 8.795,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，GPT-3到GPT-4那波就是参数从千亿到万亿级别一路狂奔。",
      "start": 204.278,
      "duration": 7.488,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。但现在大家发现了一个更核心的指标——\"每美元智能密度\"。就是说同样一块钱花出去，能换来多少智能。这个指标比纯参数大小更能反映模型的实际价值，因为最终用户关心的是\"我能用多少预算办多少事\"，不是\"你这模型内部多庞大\"。",
      "start": 212.262,
      "duration": 18.479,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "明白了。那对开发者来说意味着什么？",
      "start": 231.153,
      "duration": 3.614,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，推理成本结构正在被重写。同样预算下，你现在能调用的智能量级是几个月前的数倍。Agent、多模态应用的经济模型全都要被重新洗牌。",
      "start": 235.246,
      "duration": 13.235,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你展开说说Agent。",
      "start": 248.913,
      "duration": 2.133,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "之前Agent为什么推不动？一个核心原因就是太烧钱。一个任务动辄要调顶级模型跑几十轮，单次成本就几块钱。普通用户用不起，企业用着肉疼。但现在小模型已经能扛起80%的常规任务了，只有那20%复杂的、需要深度推理的，才上顶级模型。",
      "start": 251.514,
      "duration": 21.048,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这就跟请律师一样，简单的合同审查找个助理律师就行，复杂的官司才需要资深合伙人。",
      "start": 273.052,
      "duration": 9.404,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个类比绝了。就是这个意思。未来Agent的成本结构会从\"全员顶级\"变成\"分层路由\"，整个商业模式都会被重新定义。",
      "start": 282.933,
      "duration": 9.23,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那OpenAI这次真有点被动了？",
      "start": 292.581,
      "duration": 4.223,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说实话有点尴尬。他们之前一直走超大模型的路子，现在被Anthropic用小模型在跑分上反超，价格又打不下来。开发者社区眼睛是雪亮的，谁性价比高就用",
      "start": 297.243,
      "duration": 14.953,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好了听众朋友们，以上就是今天的AI每日先锋。感谢收听，我们明天见！",
      "start": 312.608,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "拜拜！",
      "start": 319.501,
      "duration": 1.611,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    }
  ]
}